# Keyboard Shortcut Rules

Use only the documented shortcuts (see `memory.md` "Keyboard Shortcuts" and `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md`):

```
G H → Home / Hero
G P → Projects (Work)
G S → Skills
G C → Contact
?   → Open keyboard shortcuts help dialog
Esc → Close dialog/mobile menu
```

- Do not add new shortcuts without updating `memory.md` and this file at the same time.
- Do not interfere with any browser or OS shortcut (no single-letter shortcuts that collide with common browser bindings; sequences must require the `G` prefix).
- Ignore all shortcut input while focus is inside an `input`, `textarea`, `select`, or any `contenteditable` element.
- Every shortcut must have a fully equivalent mouse/touch navigation path — shortcuts are an enhancement, never a requirement to use the site.
- Shortcuts must have zero effect on mobile/touch devices (no touch equivalent is needed).
